      "worked": "At least half of 13 means selecting at least 7 numbers. There are $2^{13}$ subsets altogether. Pair each subset with its complement. Their sizes sum to 13, so exactly one subset in each pair contains at least 7 numbers.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}N&=\\frac{2^{13}}{2}\\\\N&=4096.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
